  "story_sequence": [
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-001",
      "theme": "authoritative-markdown",
      "text": "当人类明确编辑 `docs/beacon/<version>/prd/*.md` 后，Beacon 能把当前 markdown 视为可重投影的 authoritative truth，而不是强制要求重新从 skeleton 生成。",
      "tc_ids": [
        "TC-001",
        "TC-022"
      ],
      "qa_types": [
        "interface",
        "unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-002",
      "theme": "reconcile-sinks",
      "text": "`prd reconcile` 或等价正式 surface 会同步更新至少三类 sink：`docs/beacon/<version>/prd/*.md`、`docs/beacon/<version>/.machine/prd/` 下的 canonical/compile 文件、以及 `.beacon/prd/*.json`。",
      "tc_ids": [
        "TC-002",
        "TC-023"
      ],
      "qa_types": [
        "contract",
        "unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-003",
      "theme": "deterministic-projection",
      "text": "同一份 markdown 在未变化时重复 reconcile，生成的 `source_hash / projection_seq / sink_checksums` 结果必须稳定可解释。",
      "tc_ids": [
        "TC-003",
        "TC-024"
      ],
      "qa_types": [
        "integration",
        "unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-004",
      "theme": "no-manual-json-patch",
      "text": "正常闭环下，操作者不需要手工 patch machine JSON 才能让 PRD 重回 audit-pass 状态。",
      "tc_ids": [
        "TC-004",
        "TC-025"
      ],
      "qa_types": [
        "smoke",
        "unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-005",
      "theme": "audit-legacy-and-machine",
      "text": "`prd audit` 至少同时检查 `docs/beacon/<version>/prd/*.md`、`.beacon/prd/*.json`、`docs/beacon/<version>/.machine/prd/*.canonical.json`、`docs/beacon/<version>/.machine/prd/*.compile.json`。",
      "tc_ids": [
        "TC-021"
      ],
      "qa_types": [
        "unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-006",
      "theme": "mismatch-localization",
      "text": "当任一 sink 漂移时，audit 输出必须指出是哪一类 sink 失配，而不是只给出笼统的 drift 结论。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-007",
      "theme": "contract-vs-mirror-split",
      "text": "audit 输出必须能区分“markdown contract 无效”和“markdown contract 有效但 machine mirror stale”这两类问题。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-008",
      "theme": "freeze-gate-usable",
      "text": "audit 结果必须能直接被后续 freeze / gate / doctor verify-materials 消费，而不是只作为一次性调试信息。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-009",
      "theme": "latest-transaction-pointer",
      "text": "PRD transaction 面必须存在可确定解析的 latest pointer，能够指向当前 active transaction。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-010",
      "theme": "supersedes-link",
      "text": "新 transaction 生成后，系统能表达其与前一 transaction 的 supersedes 关系，而不是只靠时间排序猜测。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-011",
      "theme": "revision-readable",
      "text": "人类和 machine surface 都能判断某一 transaction 是 `pending / applied / superseded / stale` 中的哪一种。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-012",
      "theme": "stale-history-safe",
      "text": "历史 transaction 允许保留，但不得继续被 audit / doctor / release 错认成当前 truth。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-013",
      "theme": "stale-mirror-detection",
      "text": "change-loop 至少能识别 `markdown_changed_but_machine_stale` 这一类 requirement package 状态。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-014",
      "theme": "change-route-clarity",
      "text": "当识别到 stale mirror 时，系统推荐动作必须明确指向 `beacon-change` 内的 reconcile/repair 路径，而不是继续放行 implement / qa / release。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-015",
      "theme": "fail-closed",
      "text": "对于已识别的 stale mirror，`freeze`、`implement`、`qa`、`release` 必须 fail-closed，而不是带着旧 machine truth 继续前进。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-016",
      "theme": "status-help-surface",
      "text": "`status / help / doctor advise` 这类 support surface 必须能把 stale mirror 原因明确投影给操作者。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-017",
      "theme": "reconcile-vs-repair",
      "text": "系统明确区分正常 `reconcile` 与异常 `doctor sync-materials / repair-package` 的职责边界。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-018",
      "theme": "doctor-fallback-only",
      "text": "`doctor` 相关 repair surface 仅在 machine sink 缺失、损坏或历史状态不可信时作为 fallback 推荐，而不是 PRD revise 后的默认下一步。",
      "tc_ids": [],
      "qa_types": []
    },
    {
      "ac_id": "AC-019",
      "theme": "recovery-instructions",
